  "title": "Toyota's First \"BE creation\" Spin-Off Begins Operations in Japan",
  "summary": "Toyota Motor Corporation (Toyota) announced today that OneStream Co., Ltd. (OneStream), the first company to be spun off from Toyota's new-business-creation framework, \"BE creation\", has received capital investment from three companies. Under this joint investment structure, OneStream will advance efforts to improve efficiencies in port and container logistics in Japan.",
